# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The previous site was a single page using in-page anchors, so there are few real
# legacy URLs. These map the anchors and any speculative legacy paths onto the new
# information architecture so that old links and bookmarks land somewhere sensible
# rather than on a 404.
#
# NOTE: GitHub Pages ignores this file — it has no redirect support for static
# sites. On GitHub Pages these paths will 404 to app/not-found.tsx instead.

/services            /what-we-do        301
/what-we-do.html     /what-we-do        301
/geographic-reach    /experience        301
/geography           /experience        301
/credentials         /experience        301
/commissions         /experience        301
/enquire             /contact           301
/contact.html        /contact           301
/index.html          /                  301
